<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:52:25 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>特朗普的强烈反对给政府持有的股票增加了新的风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-backlash-risks-government-stocks-intel-mp-materials-trilogy-metals/</link><description>市场策略师认为，政府的股票头寸面临华盛顿和法院审查的风险不断上升。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287372141-e1788016415733.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:19:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-backlash-risks-government-stocks-intel-mp-materials-trilogy-metals/</guid></item><item><title>忘记 GLP-1 股票吧，脱发药物是华尔街的下一个金矿</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/baldness-drug-stocks-wall-street-goldmine-veradermics-absci-cosmo/</link><description>据估计，美国有 5000 万男性和 3000 万女性患有型脱发，但自 20 世纪 90 年代末以来，一直没有新的药物获批。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2285999527.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:11:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/baldness-drug-stocks-wall-street-goldmine-veradermics-absci-cosmo/</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯正在教导孩子们如何打好未来的战争</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/russia-children-school-education-ukraine-war-recruitment-pipeline/</link><description>学生还将学习地雷和爆炸危险、战伤急救、化学和辐射暴露以及急性应激，以及在冲突地区行动的生存训练和程序。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1640909664-e1788015539263.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:03:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/russia-children-school-education-ukraine-war-recruitment-pipeline/</guid></item><item><title>对于最新的关税，特朗普使用了一项晦涩难懂的法规，许多律师甚至不知道它仍然存在。 “这项法律实际上是一张空白画布”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-tariffs-canada-trade-war-smoot-hawley-act-1930/</link><description>特朗普援引1930年关税法第338条对价值200亿美元的加拿大进口商品征收50%的税。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26240610439280-e1788014796440.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:51:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-tariffs-canada-trade-war-smoot-hawley-act-1930/</guid></item><item><title>“关于申请者群体，这句话怎么说？”联邦调查局将不再将卖淫经历视为禁止雇用的自动障碍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/applicants-fbi-experience-prostitution-automatic-disqualification-hiring/</link><description>这一转变是在现任和前任官员担心联邦调查局和司法部放宽招聘要求之际做出的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26216533003142-e1788013227743.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:26:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/applicants-fbi-experience-prostitution-automatic-disqualification-hiring/</guid></item><item><title>经过六个月的战争，伊朗强硬派巩固了权力，但“对该国未来的道路存在严重分歧”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/iran-war-hardliners-power-differences-future-path-moderates/</link><description>马苏德·佩泽什基安总统是仍然呼吁通过谈判解决问题的最知名人士之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26240607589807-e1788012565444.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:16:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/iran-war-hardliners-power-differences-future-path-moderates/</guid></item><item><title>前白宫提词器操作员在内幕交易和解中必须上交超过 10 万美元的利润并支付 65,000 美元的罚款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/former-white-house-teleprompter-operator-profits-fine-insider-trading-settlement/</link><description>周五宣布与商品期货交易委员会达成的和解协议还对加布里埃尔·佩雷斯实施三年交易禁令。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26240779913904-e1788011944981.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:03:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/former-white-house-teleprompter-operator-profits-fine-insider-trading-settlement/</guid></item><item><title>IBM 首席执行官不同意摩根大通首席执行官杰米·戴蒙 (Jamie Dimon) 对会议中发短信的蔑视：“告诉人们他们不能使用他们的技术会很奇怪”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/ibm-ceo-arvind-krishna-meeting-etiquette-disagree-jpmorgan-chase-ceo-jamie-dimon-texting-workplace-distractions/</link><description>杰米·戴蒙 (Jamie Dimon) 称在会议期间检查电子邮件是不尊重的行为，但 IBM 首席执行官表示他不在乎，这取决于房间里的人数。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-2242088737-e1762270734612.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:18:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/ibm-ceo-arvind-krishna-meeting-etiquette-disagree-jpmorgan-chase-ceo-jamie-dimon-texting-workplace-distractions/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿（Dolly Parton）曾经拒绝了埃尔维斯·普雷斯利（Elvis Presley）的歌曲请求。这只是帮助她建立 6.5 亿美元帝国的一项商业决策</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/dolly-parton-turned-down-song-request-from-elvis-presley-650-million-business-empire-success/</link><description>帕顿于 1966 年成立了自己的出版公司，这帮助她保住了几乎所有的出版权。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/GettyImages-2206129330-e1759935247900.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:14:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/dolly-parton-turned-down-song-request-from-elvis-presley-650-million-business-empire-success/</guid></item><item><title>埃文·斯皮格尔（Evan Spiegel）和彼得·蒂尔（Peter Thiel）等科技亿万富翁和高管公开保护他们的孩子免受那些让他们致富的产品的侵害</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/tech-billionaires-executives-limit-kids-screen-time-social-media-youtube-snapchat-instagram-children-technology/</link><description>随着各国政府竞相限制未成年人使用社交媒体，打造这些平台的科技亿万富翁也在家里实施严格的屏幕限制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2284748229-e1787935043835.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:11:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/tech-billionaires-executives-limit-kids-screen-time-social-media-youtube-snapchat-instagram-children-technology/</guid></item></channel></rss>